---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import BriefingForm from '../../components/BriefingForm.astro';
import CallToAction from '../../components/CallToAction.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';

// Import your team/logo images from src/assets/
import logoImage from '../../assets/meaning.png';
---

<BaseLayout title="About - Decoheron">
    <div class="container py-4">

      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="row mb-5">
        <div class="col-lg-8">
          <span class="badge bg-primary mb-3 px-3 py-2 text-uppercase fs-6">
            Our Leadership & Heritage
          </span>
          <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold text-primary mb-3">
            Built by Operators, Grounded in Governance
        </h1>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Leadership / Team Bios (Side-by-Side) -->
      <div class="row g-4 mb-5">

        <!-- Bio 1 -->
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <div class="card h-100 bg-light border border-2 border-secondary shadow-lg p-4 rounded-3">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div>
                <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-1 text-primary">Thomas Ludbrook</h2>
                <p class="text-secondary mb-0 fw-medium">Founder & Lorum Ipsum</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mb-0 text-body">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum. Sed ut perspiciatis unde omnis iste natus error sit voluptatem.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bio 2 -->
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <div class="card h-100 bg-light border border-2 border-secondary shadow-lg p-4 rounded-3">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div>
                <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-1 text-primary">Robert Shea</h2>
                <p class="text-secondary mb-0 fw-medium">Founder & Technical Partner</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mb-3 text-body">Robert brings 30 years of security expertise across battlefield systems, high-assurance computing, and enterprise defense for billion-dollar corporations. Driven by an enduring fascination with information flow, domain theory, and quantum physics, he approaches cyber risk not as operational noise, but as an exact, deterministic discipline.</p><p class="mb-0 text-body">Working alongside insurance underwriters to enforce precise technical controls, Robert converts traditional, ambiguous IT security into verifiable policy coverage and demonstrable legal protection for directors.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- About the Name & Logo Section (Single Column: Image Top, Text Below) -->
      <div class="row justify-content-center my-5">
        <div class="col-lg-10">
          <div class="p-4 p-md-2 rounded-3">

            <!-- Hero Image / Brand Mark -->
            <div class="mb-4">
              <Image src={logoImage} alt="Decoheron Name and Brand Mark" class="img-fluid mx-auto d-block" style="max-height: 300px; object-fit: contain;" loading="eager" />
            </div>

            <!-- Text Block -->
            <h2 class="h3 fw-bold text-primary mb-3">
              The Meaning Behind <span class="text-secondary">Decoheron</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-body mb-3 fs-5">In quantum physics, decoherence is the exact moment a wave of vague probabilities collapses into a single, observable reality. Decoheron is named after the theoretical particle that forces this transition.</p>
<p class="text-body mb-3 fs-5">Most boards exist in an ambiguous haze, hoping they are protected, but remaining personally liable when tested. Our logo visualizes what happens when our deterministic controls meet your infrastructure: we collapse the wavy haze of "cyber probability" into a clear, binary reality.</p>
<p class="text-body fs-5">We eliminate the guesswork, turning ambiguous risk into definitive legal protection.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
<CallToAction />
    </div>

  <BriefingForm hidden={true} />
</BaseLayout>
